<p>用了快半年的<strong>screen</strong>，最近想换成<strong>tmux</strong>试一试，所以用博客记录一下简单的使用体验。这篇博客的内容主要参考了<a href="https://www.howtogeek.com/671422/how-to-use-tmux-on-linux-and-why-its-better-than-screen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">How to Use tmux on Linux (and Why It’s Better Than Screen)</a>。</p>]]></description>
